  "title": "Republic of the Congo: TotalEnergies is Awarded a New Exploration Permit",
  "summary": "Paris, September 1, 2025 – TotalEnergies (50%, operator), together with its partners QatarEnergy (35%) and the national company SNPC (15%), has been awarded the Nzombo exploration permit in the Republic of the Congo. The 1,000 square kilometer Nzombo permit is located 100 kilometers off the coast of Pointe-Noire, close to the Moho production facilities operated by TotalEnergies EP Congo. The work […]",
